Bundled networks
----------------

`src/fedcausal/datasets/data/` contains network definitions and sampled
datasets for five Bayesian networks from the public Bayesian Network Repository
(asia, cancer, child, insurance, alarm). They ship inside the package, are
exposed through `fedcausal.datasets`, and are used by the examples, the
documentation and the test suite so that all three run without downloads.

Bayesian Network Repository: https://www.bnlearn.com/bnrepository/
